  "calculation": {
    "expression": "center(mom_10d) if median_cross_section(mom_10d)>=0 else center(-mom_10d)",
    "description": "Compute each asset's trailing 10-trading-day return. When the cross-asset median trailing return is non-negative, retain trend-following momentum; when breadth is negative, invert the signal to prefer cross-sectional reversal. Center cross-sectionally before ranking. All inputs are lagged through the decision date.",
